---
import '../../styles/v3-pages.css';
import V3CommercialHeader from '../../components/V3CommercialHeader.astro';
import V3CommercialFooter from '../../components/V3CommercialFooter.astro';
import V3Seo from '../../components/V3Seo.astro';
import { v3BlogCategoryLabel, v3BlogFeed } from '../../data/v3-blog-feed';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const articleUrl = (slug: string) => `${base}blog/${slug}/`;
const featured = v3BlogFeed.find((post) => post.featured) ?? v3BlogFeed[0];
const rest = v3BlogFeed.filter((post) => post.slug !== featured?.slug);
const categories = Array.from(new Set(v3BlogFeed.map((post) => post.category)));
const formatDate = (value: string) => new Intl.DateTimeFormat('es-ES', { day: 'numeric', month: 'long', year: 'numeric' }).format(new Date(`${value}T12:00:00`));
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <V3Seo title="Blog y noticias · IsiVoltPro" description="Noticias, actualidad de mantenimiento en España, normativa, seguridad, energía, curiosidades y guías prácticas para técnicos y pequeñas empresas." path={`${base}blog/`} />
  <style is:inline>
    .blog-hero{padding:76px 0 62px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 77% 18%,rgba(102,83,220,.12),transparent 27%),radial-gradient(circle at 91% 66%,rgba(42,188,141,.09),transparent 20%),#fff}.blog-hero__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.88fr 1.12fr;gap:58px;align-items:center}.blog-hero h1{margin:14px 0 18px;font:800 clamp(48px,5.2vw,72px)/.98 var(--v3-font-display,system-ui);letter-spacing:-.06em}.blog-hero h1 span{display:block;color:transparent;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#6754df,#4b9ed5 50%,#2fba8c);-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text}.blog-hero p{max-width:610px;margin:0;color:#717d91;line-height:1.72}.blog-topics{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:24px}.blog-topic{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:34px;padding:7px 11px;border:1px solid #e4e7f0;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.78);color:#5f6b82;font-size:11px;font-weight:850;box-shadow:0 7px 18px rgba(55,64,103,.04)}.blog-featured{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.08fr .92fr;gap:0;border:1px solid #e5e9f1;border-radius:28px;background:#fff;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 28px 70px rgba(55,64,103,.12)}.blog-featured__media{min-height:330px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#f2efff,#f4fbff 52%,#eefaf5)}.blog-featured__media img{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;object-fit:cover}.blog-featured__copy{padding:28px}.blog-kicker{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;color:#6a58d9;font-size:10px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase}.blog-kicker time{color:#8b95a7;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0;text-transform:none}.blog-featured h2{margin:14px 0 12px;font-size:30px;line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.045em}.blog-featured p{margin:0;color:#737f92;font-size:13px;line-height:1.62}.blog-link{display:inline-flex;margin-top:18px;color:#5647cf;text-decoration:none;font-size:12px;font-weight:900}.blog-trust{margin-top:24px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px}.blog-trust article{padding:14px 15px;border:1px solid rgba(224,228,239,.9);border-radius:16px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.72);backdrop-filter:blur(12px)}.blog-trust strong{display:block;font-size:12px;color:#28334a}.blog-trust span{display:block;margin-top:4px;color:#7a8599;font-size:10px;line-height:1.45}.blog-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px}.blog-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:100%;border:1px solid #e7eaf2;border-radius:24px;background:#fff;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(55,64,103,.05);transition:transform .22s ease,box-shadow .22s ease,border-color .22s ease}.blog-card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:#dcd7fb;box-shadow:0 20px 44px rgba(55,64,103,.09)}.blog-card__media{height:190px;background:#f7f8fc}.blog-card__media img{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;object-fit:cover}.blog-card__body{display:flex;flex:1;flex-direction:column;padding:19px}.blog-card h3{margin:10px 0 9px;font-size:21px;line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-.035em}.blog-card p{margin:0;color:#778297;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6}.blog-card .blog-link{margin-top:auto;padding-top:17px}.blog-method{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:14px}.blog-method article{padding:20px;border:1px solid #e7eaf2;border-radius:20px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#fff,#fafbff)}.blog-method b{display:grid;place-items:center;width:34px;height:34px;margin-bottom:13px;border-radius:10px;background:#f1efff;color:#6550dc}.blog-method strong{display:block;font-size:15px}.blog-method p{margin:6px 0 0;color:#788398;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55}@media(max-width:920px){.blog-hero__grid,.blog-featured{grid-template-columns:1fr}.blog-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.blog-featured__media{min-height:280px}.blog-method{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.blog-trust{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}}@media(max-width:620px){.blog-hero{padding:54px 0}.blog-hero h1{font-size:clamp(43px,13vw,58px)}.blog-grid,.blog-method,.blog-trust{grid-template-columns:1fr}.blog-featured__copy{padding:22px}.blog-featured h2{font-size:26px}.blog-topics{margin-top:20px}.blog-card:hover{transform:none}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.blog-card{transition:none}.blog-card:hover{transform:none}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<V3CommercialHeader />
<main class="page-main">
  <section class="blog-hero"><div class="page-shell blog-hero__grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">Blog · Noticias · Radar IsiVoltPro</span><h1>Mantenimiento al día,<span>sin ruido ni titulares vacíos.</span></h1><p>Noticias y actualidad técnica en España, normativa, seguridad, energía, curiosidades y casos prácticos. Las piezas temporales parten de una fuente verificable y explican qué cambia —o qué todavía no ha cambiado— para quien mantiene instalaciones.</p><div class="blog-topics" aria-label="Temas del Blog y Noticias">{categories.map((category) => <span class="blog-topic">{v3BlogCategoryLabel[category]}</span>)}</div><div class="blog-trust" aria-label="Compromisos editoriales"><article><strong>Fuente identificada</strong><span>Priorizamos documentación primaria cuando existe.</span></article><article><strong>Estado y fecha visibles</strong><span>Diferenciamos consulta, publicación, vigencia y cambios.</span></article><article><strong>Aplicación práctica</strong><span>Explicamos qué implica realmente para mantenimiento.</span></article></div></div>{featured && <article class="blog-featured"><div class="blog-featured__media"><img src={`${base}${featured.image.replace(/^\/+/, '')}`} alt={featured.imageAlt} width="960" height="540" /></div><div class="blog-featured__copy"><div class="blog-kicker"><span>{v3BlogCategoryLabel[featured.category]}</span><time datetime={featured.publishedAt}>{formatDate(featured.publishedAt)}</time></div><h2>{featured.title}</h2><p>{featured.excerpt}</p><a class="blog-link" href={articleUrl(featured.slug)}>Leer artículo →</a></div></article>}</div></section>

  <section class="page-section page-section--soft"><div class="page-shell"><div class="page-section__head"><div><span class="eyebrow">Últimas publicaciones y noticias</span><h2>Fuente, contexto<br/><span class="gradient-text">y aplicación práctica.</span></h2></div><p>Una noticia sirve si ayuda a decidir. Una norma sirve si sabemos su estado, fecha y alcance. Y una curiosidad sirve si enseña a mirar mejor una instalación.</p></div><div class="blog-grid">{rest.map((post) => <article class="blog-card"><div class="blog-card__media"><img src={`${base}${post.image.replace(/^\/+/, '')}`} alt={post.imageAlt} loading="lazy" width="960" height="540" /></div><div class="blog-card__body"><div class="blog-kicker"><span>{v3BlogCategoryLabel[post.category]}</span><time datetime={post.publishedAt}>{formatDate(post.publishedAt)}</time></div><h3>{post.title}</h3><p>{post.excerpt}</p><a class="blog-link" href={articleUrl(post.slug)}>Leer artículo →</a></div></article>)}</div></div></section>

  <section class="page-section"><div class="page-shell"><div class="page-section__head"><div><span class="eyebrow">Línea editorial</span><h2>Publicar con frecuencia,<br/><span class="gradient-text">sin sacrificar rigor.</span></h2></div><p>La frecuencia no puede convertir IsiVoltPro en un agregador de titulares. Cada pieza entra por una categoría, conserva su fuente y se adapta después a cada red social.</p></div><div class="blog-method"><article><b>01</b><strong>Fuente original</strong><p>BOE, ministerios, INSST, IDAE, CNMC, EUR-Lex u otra fuente primaria cuando exista.</p></article><article><b>02</b><strong>Estado correcto</strong><p>Consulta, propuesta, publicada, vigente, modificada o derogada: no son lo mismo.</p></article><article><b>03</b><strong>Lectura práctica</strong><p>Traducimos la novedad a lo que debería mirar un técnico o responsable de mantenimiento.</p></article><article><b>04</b><strong>Redes adaptadas</strong><p>Instagram, Facebook y LinkedIn reciben versiones propias y aprobación separada.</p></article></div></div></section>
</main>
<V3CommercialFooter />
</body>
</html>
